@startuml
title TCP-ish connection lifecycle

[*] --> Closed

Closed --> Connecting : open()
Connecting --> Connected : ack
Connecting --> Closed : timeout

state Connected {
  [*] --> Idle
  Idle --> Sending : write()
  Sending --> Idle : flushed
  Idle --> Receiving : data
  Receiving --> Idle : consumed
}

Connected --> Closing : close()
Closing --> Closed : fin
Connected --> Failed : error
Failed --> Closed : reset
Closed --> [*]
@enduml
